  "legacy_defects": [
    "a forwarded report mails the superior but drives nobody, although its class is TX_POST",
    "a top-level caller's ask and scope request, withdraw_ask and every audience action keep nothing in their receipts",
    "watchdog list is a read that saves, broadcasts and, keyed, files a receipt",
    "the operator audience grant drives the grantee with 'You have new mail above.' although it posted no mail"
  ],
  "scope": "Legacy boundary of asks, reports, scope requests, watchdogs and audiences (P01 F3) on disposable SQLite: seven agent tools (per action for orgtree_watchdog and orgtree_audience) and six routes. Turn delivery, the smoke run and the broadcasts are spies; the doors, the ledger, the receipts, save and reload are real. Legacy conformance evidence only: not a runtime census, not PostgreSQL or Rust qualification."
